<title>GREECE: TABLE-Greek/Bund gap shrinks to 405bps, 312 vs BTP.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Greek/Bund gap shrinks to 405bps, 312 vs BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread between Greece's 10-year bond over bunds narrowed to 405 basis points on Thursday from Wednesday's 408.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap also shrank to 312 basis points from 313 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.53%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.00%   04JUL07    5.48%	405	408 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.50%   25APR07    5.40%	413	416 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.41%	312	313 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.20%	333	337 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.11%	342	345 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.01%	252	255 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.14%	339	339 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 0900 GMT.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
